    "updated_at": "2018-06-22T17:25:57Z",
    "body": "If/when `max-age` is provided, I would recommend updating the \"equivalent\" sample to use it.\r\n\r\nHere's what it says right now:\r\n```js\r\nasync function setExpiredSecureCookieWithDomainPathAndFallbackValue() {\r\n  let theVeryRecentPast = Date.now();\r\n  let expiredCookieSentinelValue = 'EXPIRED';\r\n  await cookieStore.set('__Secure-COOKIENAME', expiredCookieSentinelValue, {\r\n      path: '/cgi-bin/',\r\n      expires: theVeryRecentPast,\r\n      secure: true,\r\n      domain: 'example.org'\r\n    });\r\n  console.log('Expired! Deleted!! Cleared!!1!');\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'd propose changing it to:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nasync function setExpiredSecureCookieWithDomainPathAndFallbackValue() {\r\n  let expiredCookieSentinelValue = 'EXPIRED';\r\n  await cookieStore.set('__Secure-COOKIENAME', expiredCookieSentinelValue, {\r\n      path: '/cgi-bin/',\r\n      maxAge: 0,\r\n      secure: true,\r\n      domain: 'example.org'\r\n    });\r\n  console.log('Expired! Deleted!! Cleared!!1!');\r\n}\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
