    "updated_at": "2018-06-22T18:46:31Z",
    "body": "If this is still open to feedback, I think `max-age` is way nicer than `expires`, and I'm betting that users of this API will agree that `max-age` is better.\r\n\r\nI note that all of the examples in the spec are relative to `Date.now()`; they would all be easier to use/read if they were stated in `max-age` format.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
