    "created_at": "2025-07-15T13:37:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-15T13:37:13Z",
    "body": "> Supporting expires but not max-age was intentional, although the reasoning should be documented.\n\nI see the explainer has \"The inconsistently-implemented Max-Age parameter is not exposed\", though I'm not aware of how it's inconsistently implemented. Is that still the case and is that the only concern?\n\nGenerally speaking relative times are preferable as they are easier to use and you don't run into issues with the client and server clocks being askew, so I think it would make sense to add this.",
